{"object":"toolset","id":"137","title":"[手机]ONScripter模拟器资源解包工具","aliases":["手机ONS解包工具"],"toolset_type":"extractor","interface_language":"zh-cn","platform":"linux","release_channel":"alpha","homepage_urls":[],"author":{"object":"user","id":"135666","name":"D-kaiser","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/9b/f8/9bf80d93dab43f1b33a59768263cf505e4a6af4071fcb2444449231620c63b73.webp","hash":"9bf80d93dab43f1b33a59768263cf505e4a6af4071fcb2444449231620c63b73","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null},"view_count":28,"download_count":0,"comment_count":1,"favorite_count":0,"practicality_average":null,"practicality_count":0,"practicality_distribution":[0,0,0,0,0],"created_at":"2026-10-16T17:42:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T17:45:11Z","edited_at":"2026-10-16T17:45:11Z","resource_updated_at":"2026-10-16T17:42:32Z","content":{"object":"document","children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"这个工具为python脚本,理论上windows,Android等都能运行,本人只于Android termux测试."}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"本工具需求:"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"1.Android软件 termux"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"2.python软件包"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"3.python的pip包"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"(4.MT管理器:方便文件操作,非必需)"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"功能:"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"$$完美解包.nsa,.ns2封包,保持原文件结构."}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"使用场景:当你玩ONScripter引擎游戏时,想提取音频,CG等"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"食用用法:"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"下载后,后缀改为.py"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"把目标文件复制到别的目录(我爱用\"/storage/emulated/0/termux/\")"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python运行"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"# 🚀 自动扫描当前目录及子目录所有 .ns2 / .ns / .nsa 并解包"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python ns_tool.py"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"# 📌 解包指定文件"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python ns_tool.py unpack arc1.nsa"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"# 📌 解包多个文件"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python ns_tool.py unpack arc1.nsa arc3.nsa 05.ns2"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"# 📌 直接传文件名也行（自动检测是解包操作）"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python ns_tool.py 01.ns2"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"# 📦 打包为 .ns2 引号格式"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python ns_tool.py pack 05.ns2_out 05_repacked.ns2"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"# 📦 打包为 .nsa 标准格式（输出文件以 .nsa 结尾即自动选择）"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"python ns_tool.py pack arc1.nsa_out arc1_repacked.nsa"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"打包功能我没测试,正常人用不到,nscripter脚本文件加解密(xor加密)脚本也写了,暂时懒得发布……"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"注意:本人只测试了\"美少女万华镜5\"的. ns2与\"妹调教日记\"的.nsa,有问题欢迎指出,但我只看心情更新！(windows运行及termux使用问题本人不解决)"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"关于本脚本:coder by qwen3.8"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"BUT！里面的提取思路,方法绝对为本人独立想到！从最开始用kimi AI暴力破解,按文件标识头/尾[会丢失原数据结构]的一代脚本,到这个花费了大量时间(主要是S.B. AI只想着暴力提取,还好我用termux的binwalk与MT管理器的16进制编辑器分析了一下文件提醒AI)"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"第一次发布,排班有点乱."}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"密码:8ejh"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"密码:8ejh"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"密码:8ejh"}]},{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"link","url":"https://wwbnp.lanzn.com/iBMo84c9fm1e%20%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81:8ejh","children":[{"object":"text","value":"https://wwbnp.lanzn.com/iBMo84c9fm1e"}]}]}]},"contributors":[{"object":"user","id":"135666","name":"D-kaiser","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/9b/f8/9bf80d93dab43f1b33a59768263cf505e4a6af4071fcb2444449231620c63b73.webp","hash":"9bf80d93dab43f1b33a59768263cf505e4a6af4071fcb2444449231620c63b73","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null}],"toolset_resources":[],"viewer":null}
